---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import InsuranceForm from '../components/InsuranceForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Verify Your Insurance"
  description="Check your therapy benefits. Share a few details and Jennifer Pearson, LCSW will verify your behavioral-health coverage for you."
>
  <section class="bg-cream-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 text-center">
      <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sage-600">Insurance</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Verify your benefits</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-ink-700">
        Let me do the legwork. Share a little information below and I'll check
        what your plan covers, then follow up securely by email.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-14">
    <InsuranceForm />
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink-700">
      It's also a good idea to call the member services number on the back of your
      insurance card and ask about your outpatient mental health benefits, what your
      copay and deductible are, and whether there are any visit limits. Checking
      directly with your insurer is the surest way to understand your coverage and costs.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
